{"case_id": "m03", "rep": 0, "suite": "maths", "variant": "deepseek__deepseek-v4-flash@low", "model": "deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash", "effort": "low", "group": "open", "status": "ok", "grade_level": 8, "tags": ["Whole numbers"], "output": "**Solution**\n\nTotal number of parts = 2 + 3 + 4 = 9 parts  \n\nThe largest share corresponds to the part with 4 parts.  \n\n\\[\n\\text{Largest share} = \\frac{4}{9} \\times 360\n\\]\n\n\\[\n= 4 \\times 40 = 160\n\\]\n\n∴ The person with the largest share gets **R160**.", "pred": null, "grade": {"correct": 1.0}, "judge": null, "latency_s": 2.667, "calls": 1, "input_tokens": 464, "output_tokens": 184, "reasoning_tokens": 91, "cost_usd": 0.000116, "served_models": ["deepseek/deepseek-v4-flash"], "hosts": ["Parasail"], "finish_reasons": ["stop"], "judge_cost_usd": 0.0, "ts": "2026-10-31T17:29:56"}
